 adhesion and migration (PubMed:32228863). May also be involved in retrograde transport from endosomes to the trans-Golgi network (TGN) (PubMed:26157166). Contributes to hippocampal spatial and contextual memory by maintaining Golgi function and structural integrity in hippocampal neurons (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}